## Development Workflow

1. `task dev` — Start all services (backend + frontend)
2. `task check` — Full quality gate before committing (lint + tests + typecheck)
3. `task db:revision` — Create new Alembic migration
4. `task registry:generate` — Regenerate naming constants after registry changes
5. `/commit` in Claude Code — Create conventional commit from staged changes
